{"id":"c9a2f15ef4424ad4","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value.md","title":"形式树序数的外延序数值","display":"df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value — 形式树序数的外延序数值","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value","aliases":["72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value"],"display":"df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value — 形式树序数的外延序数值","depends_on":["[[72-df-tree-ordinal]]"],"chapter":"III","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III §2, print153–160/PDF165–172; local map forgetting fundamental-sequence data","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value — 形式树序数的外延序数值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" href=\"?note=2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal\">72-df-tree-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III §2, print153–160/PDF165–172; local map forgetting fundamental-sequence data"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L,\\prec\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L,\\prec\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" href=\"?note=2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal\">72-df-tree-ordinal</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\Omega\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\Omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\alpha_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\\in\\Omega^\\omega\">\\((\\alpha_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\\in\\Omega^\\omega\\)</span>；在 ZFC 中沿严格子树关系作良基递归。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Omega\">\\(v_\\Omega\\)</span> 的值是实际序数，不是树编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v_\\Omega(\\mathbf0):=0,\\qquad\nv_\\Omega(\\mathsf S\\alpha):=v_\\Omega(\\alpha)+1,\\qquad\nv_\\Omega(\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_i)):=\\sup_{i\\in\\omega}v_\\Omega(\\alpha_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v_\\Omega(\\mathbf0):=0,\\qquad\nv_\\Omega(\\mathsf S\\alpha):=v_\\Omega(\\alpha)+1,\\qquad\nv_\\Omega(\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_i)):=\\sup_{i\\in\\omega}v_\\Omega(\\alpha_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v_\\Omega:\\Omega\\to\\omega_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v_\\Omega:\\Omega\\to\\omega_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任一节点只调用真子树值；可数个可数序数的上确界仍可数，递归产生集合函数。形式极限只取子值的上确界，不额外加一；因此它与地址树的良基秩不同。没有对全部形式树声称严格保序或单射，下一例给出反例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target"